                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">PALM-4U — urban microclimate (skeleton)

1  Define the grid over your site (lower-left corner at the Rhino origin, y = north).
2  Wire terrain, buildings and tree crowns into PALM Static Driver, toggle Write.
3  Set wind + duration in PALM Settings, then toggle Run.
4  Watch PALM Progress; read PET/UTCI maps in PALM Results.

Needs the PALM container image — Eddy3D Setup → Urban microclimate (PALM-4U).</item>
                  </items>
